OL,3,GNEWSAInfluencer's partner denies
OL,4,Aracially abusing women
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe partner of a pro-Donald Trump
OL,7,Fsocial media influencer racially abused
OL,8,Ftwo sisters before aiming pepper spray
OL,9,Fat them near a London Underground
OL,10,Fstation, a court has heard.
OL,12,FPhilipp Ostermann, 38, allegedly said
OL,13,F"you bloody Indians" to Sabba and
OL,14,FMarium Javed after Melissa Rein Lively
OL,15,Fstumbled over a pram carrying one of
OL,16,FSabba's children.
OL,18,FThe confrontation near Bond Street
OL,19,Fstation left one of the sisters feeling
OL,20,Fshe was "not welcome in my home", the
OL,21,Ftrial at City of London Magistrates'
OL,22,FCourt heard.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
