OL,3,GNEWSAInfluencer's partner denies
OL,4,Aracially abusing women
OL,5,
OL,6,FOstermann, who provided a home address
OL,7,Fin his native Germany, denies two
OL,8,Fcounts of causing racially aggravated
OL,9,Fharassment and one count of using
OL,10,Fthreatening, abusive or insulting words
OL,11,For behaviour.
